sequenceDiagram
    actor Usuario
    participant Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Redis
    participant Worker as Celery
    participant CV as OpenCV
    participant OCR as Tesseract

    Usuario->>Frontend: Selecciona factura
    Frontend->>API: POST /invoices/upload
    API->>API: Valida formato, firma y tamaño
    API->>DB: Registra PENDING y bitácora UPLOAD
    API->>Redis: Encola process_invoice
    API-->>Frontend: invoice + task_id
    Redis->>Worker: Entrega tarea
    Worker->>DB: Cambia a PROCESSING
    Worker->>CV: Carga y preprocesa
    CV-->>Worker: Imagen procesada
    Worker->>OCR: Extrae texto
    OCR-->>Worker: Texto y confianza
    Worker->>Worker: Parser y validaciones
    Worker->>DB: Guarda campos, estado y bitácora
    Frontend->>API: Consulta estado
    API->>DB: SELECT factura
    API-->>Frontend: Resultado
